            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-8215, Egg-Shaped Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple cabinet knob is available in 9 finishes including polished chrome, polished brass (pictured), and oil rubbed bronze. It is versatile in the way that the finish that you choose can transform this egg-shaped cabinet pull into something that will go great in modern homes or something that is more traditional. The Egg Cabinet Knob made by RK International is the perfect example of class and the beauty of simplicity. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-8215 Football Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
